message: "If you use this work, please cite it using these metadata."

title: "Van Aubel Extensions"

authors:
  - given-names: "Charles"
    alias: "mindofcharles"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8326-876X"

abstract: >-
  A mathematical study of Van Aubel's theorem through complex structures,
  including higher-dimensional realizations, edge-operator classification and rigidity,
  and complex-affine naturality and transfer.
  The repository also contains supporting Lean 4 checks,
  numerical consistency tests, and an interactive demonstration.

keywords:
  - "Van Aubel theorem"
  - "complex structures"
  - "affine geometry"
  - "Euclidean geometry"
  - "Lean"
  - "formal verification"

repository-code: "https://github.com/mindofcharles/Van-Aubel-Extensions"

